# Local agent context file
CLAUDE.md

# Model-eval artifacts (LoRA adapters, checkpoints, metrics CSVs) — too large for git
# (the Aug-12 Gemma LoRA pilot alone is ~251 MB of optimizer state).
# REPORT.md narrative summaries ARE tracked (a few KB each, the hand-off artifact).
# Needs all three lines: git cannot re-include a file whose parent dir is excluded,
# so we exclude the *contents*, keep directories walkable, then re-include REPORT.md.
scripts/model/results/**
!scripts/model/results/**/
!scripts/model/results/**/REPORT.md

# Probe activation captures (GBs of fp16 hidden states) — machine-local;
# the jsonl metadata + REPORT.md alongside them stay tracked.
psiml_data/probes/*/activations/
